{
  "appliance_id": "b7e9c2d1-4a5f-4b8e-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d",
  "name": "IEC 61850 IED Publisher",
  "category": "guest",
  "description": "IEC 61850 GOOSE/SV traffic publisher (simulated IED). Emits GOOSE (0x88B8) and Sampled Values (0x88BA) frames on its Ethernet port with configurable APPID, rate, VLAN ID and priority, including GOOSE-style retransmission bursts. Use with the Subscriber node or a real IED/substation switch to verify PRP transparency.",
  "vendor_name": "Arctic3D AB",
  "vendor_url": "https://arctic3d.xyz",
  "product_name": "IEC 61850 IED Publisher",
  "registry_version": 6,
  "status": "experimental",
  "maintainer": "Arctic3D AB",
  "maintainer_email": "ceo@arctic3d.xyz",
  "usage": "IEC 61850 IED PUBLISHER\n========================\n\nSimulated IED that publishes real IEC 61850 GOOSE (0x88B8) and Sampled\nValues (0x88BA) frames. The APDUs are fully ASN.1/BER encoded, so\nWireshark and real IEDs decode them. Attach the node to a RedBox SAN\nport.\n\nThe console shows a live stats view; the telnet aux console on port\n5000 gives a shell.\n\nENVIRONMENT VARIABLES\n---------------------\n\nSet these per node (right-click the node, Configure, General,\nEnvironment).\n\n  IEC_MODE           (default publisher)\n    IED personality: publisher or subscriber.\n\n  IEC_APPID          (default 0x1001)\n    GOOSE application ID, hex.\n\n  IEC_ET             (default goose)\n    goose (0x88B8) or sv (0x88BA).\n\n  IEC_RATE           (default 5)\n    Publish rate in frames per second.\n\n  IEC_VID            (default 0)\n    VLAN ID; 0 = null VLAN with priority tagging, the IEC 61850\n    legacy default.\n\n  IEC_PCP            (default 4)\n    802.1Q priority bits.\n\n  IEC_MCAST          (default per IEC_ET)\n    Destination MAC override.\n\n  IEC_GCB            (default LLN0$GO$gcb0)\n    GOOSE control-block reference (gocbRef).\n\n  IEC_DSET           (default LLN0$dataset)\n    GOOSE dataset reference (datSet).\n\n  IEC_GOID           (default LLN0$GO$gcb0)\n    GOOSE ID (goID).\n\n  IEC_CONFREV        (default 1)\n    Configuration revision (confRev).\n\n  IEC_SVID           (default MU01)\n    SV svID.\n\n  IEC_STEVENTS       (default 10)\n    GOOSE state changes per N events (stNum increments on each change).\n\nGOOSE stNum increments on each state change; sqNum increments per\nretransmission (2/4/8/16 ms bursts, like a real IED). SV smpCnt\nincrements per frame (mod 4096).\n\nVERIFICATION\n------------\n\nPair this node with the Subscriber node on the other side of a PRP\nnetwork or HSR ring. The subscriber console showing dupes=0 proves\nexactly-once delivery.",
  "docker": {
    "adapters": 1,
    "image": "ghcr.io/grymme/prp-sim:latest",
    "console_type": "telnet",
    "environment": "IEC_MODE=publisher\nIEC_APPID=0x1001\nIEC_RATE=5\nIEC_VID=0\nIEC_PCP=4\nIEC_ET=goose"
  },
  "symbols": {
    "default": "symbols/iec61850-publisher.svg"
  }
}
